{"unit_id":"stargacha__stargacha-#card-zh","repo":"stargacha/stargacha-","commit":"6597c208b2764263ee2547964531653c19ee59ab","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"星穹召唤（Astral Summon）是一款运行在 DSH Web 版侧栏中的抽卡与角色聊天插件。它将小游戏嵌入 DSH 页面，提供单抽和十连抽、角色收藏与抽卡记录、单人聊天及 2 至 4 人群聊，并支持选择 DSH 已配置的模型继续对话。游戏存档和聊天记录保存在浏览器本地，聊天通过 DSH 模型服务生成；需要使用 DSH Web 并先配置可用模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:15-26","index.js:61-85","game/index.html:1037-1068","game/index.html:1465-1486","index.js:123-145"]}
{"unit_id":"stargacha__stargacha-#card-en","repo":"stargacha/stargacha-","commit":"6597c208b2764263ee2547964531653c19ee59ab","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Astral Summon is a gacha and character chat game in the DSH Web sidebar. It offers single and ten-card pulls, a character collection and history, one-to-one chats, and group chats with two to four characters. Chat uses a DSH-configured model; saves and chat history stay in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:15-26","index.js:61-85","game/index.html:1037-1068","game/index.html:1465-1486","index.js:123-145"]}
